read-safe-apis) seems to indicate this should work? Is it possible this issue is because I'm using C# and not GDScript (because I see the error is coming from the C# wrapper)?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nNot adding this for now, as I'm not clear that this is a bug that needs fixing.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot adding this for now, as I'm not clear that this is a bug that needs fixing.","closed_by":{"login":"Avantir-Chaosfire","id":11003232,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDAzMjMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11003232?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avantir-Chaosfire","html_url":"https://github.com/Avantir-Chaosfire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avantir-Chaosfire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avantir-Chaosfire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avantir-Chaosfire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avantir-Chaosfire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avantir-Chaosfire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avantir-Chaosfire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avantir-Chaosfire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avantir-Chaosfire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avantir-Chaosfire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101170/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101170/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}